    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Within genera or families, compare standardized among-species divergence and within-species variance for secondary sexual traits versus other morphology. Larger values for sexual traits support the claim; comparable or smaller divergence refutes it.";
