    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.1.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Public media and specimens are heavily biased toward birds and conspicuous traits.", "Trait classes need comparable scaling and sampling.";
